# Beastmaster's native check by parity for #148 (Pack Hunt) and #144 (every special form shows its Warcraft spell).
# Beastmaster a against Beastmaster b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
# A side special from standing starts a dash too, so each one slides its caster about 120.
#! chat -dev quick hero beastmaster
# b dashes right and summons its bear, then commands it right and left.
40 b stick 1 0
42 b stick 0 0
# a: Quillbeast Dart on the ground and in the air.
50 a stick 0 -1
50 a tap X 2
51 a stick 0 0
52 a capture
60 b stick 1 0
60 b tap X 2
61 b stick 0 0
68 a capture
100 a tap B 8
106 a stick 0 -1
106 a tap X 2
107 a stick 0 0
108 a capture
124 a capture
130 b stick 1 0
130 b tap X 2
131 b stick 0 0
# a summons its bear, then runs up to b with the bear following.
165 a stick 1 0
165 a tap X 2
166 a stick 0 0
167 a capture
185 b stick -1 0
185 b tap X 2
186 b stick 0 0
195 a capture
225 a stick 1 0
250 a stick 0 0
# #148 Pack Hunt: a jabs b, then orders its bear's lunge (stick held through the jab, so no dash): the bite lands 3 harder.
310 a tap A 2
314 a capture
315 a stick 1 0
330 a tap X 2
334 a tap X 2
336 a stick 0 0
336 a capture
338 a capture
349 a capture
# Bear Recall.
360 a stick 0 -1
360 a tap X 2
361 a stick 0 0
362 a capture
364 a capture
# a runs back left, then throws the Throwing Axe on the ground and in the air.
390 a stick -1 0
# b climbs back from the ledge, then Hawk Lifts until its mana runs out and the free form rises.
400 b stick 0 1
402 b stick 0 0
415 a stick 0 0
430 a tap X 2
432 a capture
440 b stick -0.4 1
440 b tap X 2
441 b stick 0 0
450 a capture
480 a tap B 8
486 a tap X 2
488 a capture
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
506 a capture
530 b stick -0.4 1
530 b tap X 2
531 b stick 0 0
# a: Hawk Lift.
550 a stick 0 1
550 a tap X 2
551 a stick 0 0
552 a capture
560 a capture
570 a release VIEW
620 b stick -0.4 1
620 b tap X 2
621 b stick 0 0
710 b stick -0.4 1
710 b tap X 2
711 b stick 0 0
800 b stick -0.4 1
800 b tap X 2
801 b stick 0 0
890 b stick -0.4 1
890 b tap X 2
891 b stick 0 0
980 b stick -0.4 1
980 b tap X 2
981 b stick 0 0
982 b capture
990 b capture
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
1070 b stick -0.4 1
1070 b tap X 2
1071 b stick 0 0
